{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to the Supply Department.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The year is 2037. After the war, Great Raskovia is in the midst of a deep economic crisis. You get a job as a civil servant, who distributes rations to citizens based on document checks. Among them, there may be fraudsters, enemies, or even children wanting to live at the state's expense.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694760/extras/Alternative.gif?t=1746722001\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will need to check documents, verify data, and make decisions based on that \u2014 either distribute rations or deny them. As the days go by, the rules become stricter. Your decisions affect the development of the story and the well-being of your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694760/extras/AlternativeCity.gif?t=1746722001\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A story with multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Daily moral dilemmas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Completing tasks in the city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Atmospheric visual and sound design</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694760?t=1746722001","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694760/ab1a736723395aeebbfef04c76fb36e62f1c40ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746722001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694760/2d25e2894f07a2077b95909c26a95f900e226890/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746722001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694760/2d25e2894f07a2077b95909c26a95f900e226890/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746722001","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"\"Alternative\" features mature themes such as: politics, crime, death and health."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to the Supply Department.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The year is 2037. After the war, Great Raskovia is in the midst of a deep economic crisis. You get a job as a civil servant, who distributes rations to citizens based on document checks. Among them, there may be fraudsters, enemies, or even children wanting to live at the state's expense.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694760/extras/Alternative.gif?t=1746722001\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will need to check documents, verify data, and make decisions based on that \u2014 either distribute rations or deny them. As the days go by, the rules become stricter. Your decisions affect the development of the story and the well-being of your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694760/extras/AlternativeCity.gif?t=1746722001\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A story with multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Daily moral dilemmas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Completing tasks in the city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Atmospheric visual and sound design</p>","developers":["Luxar"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694760/643d06f2071c8944e90afceca9af4f90e6d4fa1c/header.jpg?t=1746722001","is_free":false,"li